+
+-   `Dialog`, `AlertDialog`, `Popover`, `Tooltip`, `Select`: Fix broken focus-trap caused by ThemeProvider's `display: contents` and Base UI's `checkVisibility()` ([#77381](https://github.com/WordPress/gutenberg/pull/77381)).
+
 ## 0.11.0 (2026-04-15)
 
 ### Breaking Changes
